WEBVTT

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:43.756
[This drama is a work of fiction.]

00:00:43.756 --> 00:00:44.795
[Any resemblance to real persons,
places, or events is coincidental.]

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:45.817
[Scenes with child actors and animals
were filmed safely]

00:00:45.817 --> 00:00:47.137
[under professional supervision.]

00:00:56.492 --> 00:00:58.777
[Episode 9]

00:01:01.746 --> 00:01:04.359
Sang Ah.

00:01:28.725 --> 00:01:31.944
<i>Director Lee asked me to give you this.</i>

00:02:59.453 --> 00:03:03.527
[100% real, not edited,
not manipulated, not AI]

00:03:06.354 --> 00:03:08.110
[Private video scandal spreading in real time]

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:10.670
[Shocking footage of Chu Sang Ah leaked]

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.359
[Is this the end of
Bang Tae Seop's political career]

00:03:14.359 --> 00:03:17.918
[Her husband's in politics? Unbelievable]

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:25.299
<i>Voting in the 22nd National Assembly election
closed just moments ago at 6 p.m.</i>

00:03:25.299 --> 00:03:30.082
<i>We'll soon begin counting the ballots
to see where the public's choice is headed.</i>

00:03:30.082 --> 00:03:33.786
<i>Let's go live to the counting site
and check in on the situation.</i>

00:03:33.786 --> 00:03:34.856
<i>Reporter Jeon,</i>

00:03:34.856 --> 00:03:37.363
<i>how are preparations
for the count coming along?</i>

00:03:37.363 --> 00:03:39.880
Hey, Reporter Hwang.
Lean into the Son Guk Won story.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.013
This shouldn't get buried
over some tabloid scandal.

00:03:42.013 --> 00:03:44.947
Get it everywhere. Damn it.

00:03:44.947 --> 00:03:48.691
This isn't just gossip right now.

00:03:48.691 --> 00:03:49.928
<i>Think about it.</i>

00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:52.037
With a scandal like this,
something we've never seen before...

00:03:52.037 --> 00:03:53.880
Who's paying attention to politics?

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.171
Hey.

00:03:55.171 --> 00:03:56.673
<i>And on top of that...</i>

00:03:56.673 --> 00:03:58.571
Looks like Son Guk Won's people stepped in.

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:01.069
The higher-ups are already killing the story.

00:04:01.069 --> 00:04:02.914
<i>Anyway,</i>

00:04:02.914 --> 00:04:05.234
<i>that's as far as I can go.</i>

00:04:05.234 --> 00:04:07.047
Hey.

00:04:07.047 --> 00:04:08.764
You've got media in your pocket.

00:04:08.764 --> 00:04:12.399
Since when do you play by the rules? Damn it.

00:04:12.399 --> 00:04:14.693
Hey!

00:04:28.588 --> 00:04:30.178
Hello, sir.

00:04:30.178 --> 00:04:32.825
<i>Do you think this election is a joke?</i>

00:04:32.825 --> 00:04:34.862
<i>You promised to save that card
for the big stage,</i>

00:04:34.862 --> 00:04:37.756
<i>and you just played it
whenever you felt like it?</i>

00:04:37.756 --> 00:04:40.595
<i>You don't care
what happens to the party, is that it?</i>

00:04:40.595 --> 00:04:43.068
No, sir. I'll clear this up and fix it.

00:04:43.068 --> 00:04:44.245
- I will...
<i>- Save it.</i>

00:04:44.245 --> 00:04:47.539
<i>I'll set up a press conference,
so keep it clean.</i>

00:04:47.539 --> 00:04:50.548
<i>This is so embarrassing.</i>

00:05:17.723 --> 00:05:19.014
Mr. Kwon.

00:05:19.014 --> 00:05:22.069
I need you to cover for me...

00:05:25.277 --> 00:05:29.316
<i>The number you have dialed is unavailable...</i>

00:05:44.118 --> 00:05:47.102
Damn it! I'll kill them!

00:05:47.102 --> 00:05:48.411
Fuck!

00:05:48.411 --> 00:05:52.082
I'll kill every last one of them!

00:06:10.037 --> 00:06:12.300
<i>I'm pulling out.</i>

00:06:22.088 --> 00:06:23.838
Is candidate Bang Tae Seop inside?

00:06:23.838 --> 00:06:26.461
How is he responding to this?

00:06:32.371 --> 00:06:34.309
<i>Assemblyman, what's your take?</i>

00:06:34.309 --> 00:06:36.695
<i>The momentum was on his side.</i>

00:06:36.695 --> 00:06:39.515
<i>No one saw a reversal like this coming.</i>

00:06:39.515 --> 00:06:42.713
<i>Bang Tae Seop's camp
popped the champagne way too early.</i>

00:06:42.713 --> 00:06:45.978
<i>At this point, his political career is over.</i>

00:06:45.978 --> 00:06:48.249
<i>I see. As you said,</i>

00:06:48.249 --> 00:06:52.802
<i>a camp that was so confident about winning
must feel like a funeral now.</i>

00:06:52.802 --> 00:06:54.812
<i>It was a knockout blow.</i>

00:06:54.812 --> 00:07:00.955
<i>Public opinion flipped
before the campaign even had time to respond.</i>

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:13.510
What did I tell you?

00:07:14.323 --> 00:07:18.134
Nothing beats a sex scandal.

00:07:18.134 --> 00:07:20.158
I'll keep that in mind.

00:07:20.158 --> 00:07:24.481
Now you can cruise all the way
to the Blue House.

00:07:24.481 --> 00:07:28.120
- Have a drink.
- Sure.

00:07:32.181 --> 00:07:33.224
Cheers.

00:07:33.224 --> 00:07:35.394
Cheers.

00:07:44.997 --> 00:07:48.674
<i>Let's take a look at Dongnam-gap,
where things took a dramatic turn.</i>

00:07:48.674 --> 00:07:53.294
<i>Candidate Park Hong Jip, with 64.5%...</i>

00:07:53.294 --> 00:07:56.640
<i>is projected to win.</i>

00:07:57.814 --> 00:08:00.647
Who the hell are you guys?

00:08:00.647 --> 00:08:04.167
Yes, sir. I'll put him on.

00:08:05.682 --> 00:08:08.445
<i>Hey, Bang Tae Seop.</i>

00:08:08.445 --> 00:08:10.253
You look pathetic right now.

00:08:10.253 --> 00:08:13.148
<i>Hell, so do I. Damn it.</i>

00:08:13.148 --> 00:08:15.366
Sir, well...

00:08:15.366 --> 00:08:17.046
I'll get this under control first...

00:08:17.046 --> 00:08:18.232
<i>Save it.</i>

00:08:18.232 --> 00:08:22.172
<i>As of today, that investment is now your debt.</i>

00:08:22.172 --> 00:08:25.049
<i>Pick up your phone</i>

00:08:25.049 --> 00:08:28.994
<i>and pay it all back in cash.</i>

00:09:02.453 --> 00:09:05.798
[No. 2, Bang Tae Seop]

00:09:17.235 --> 00:09:20.385
It's a one-way ticket for tomorrow.

00:09:20.385 --> 00:09:24.279
I had a box sent to your place,
so it should be there by now.

00:09:24.279 --> 00:09:30.192
You're done here.
Get lost, and don't come back.

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:45.311
If it weren't for us,
you'd be rotting in prison.

00:09:45.311 --> 00:09:48.850
So keep your mouth shut and leave.

00:09:50.337 --> 00:09:53.930
You've got it wrong.

00:09:57.104 --> 00:10:02.010
You didn't catch me. I was set up.

00:10:06.235 --> 00:10:09.757
Tell Director Lee Yang Mi this.

00:10:09.757 --> 00:10:14.210
She'd better stay away from Chu Sang Ah.

00:10:20.539 --> 00:10:24.319
What's got you so confident...

00:10:28.692 --> 00:10:32.058
You've got something, don't you?

00:10:47.341 --> 00:10:50.221
Sang Ah.

00:10:50.221 --> 00:10:52.898
Hwang Jeong Won was a mole.

00:10:52.898 --> 00:10:56.483
<i>It was all Choi Ji Ho and Director Lee Yang Mi.</i>

00:10:56.483 --> 00:10:58.936
And when Jeong Won got pinned as the killer,
she dragged you...

00:10:58.936 --> 00:11:01.102
<i>Hey...</i>

00:11:02.085 --> 00:11:04.852
I'm hanging up.

00:11:48.826 --> 00:11:51.250
Say something.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:54.766
Anything.

00:12:04.089 --> 00:12:07.182
I know anything I say right now

00:12:07.182 --> 00:12:11.043
will sound like an excuse...

00:12:13.003 --> 00:12:16.856
but that night, I wasn't in my right mind.

00:12:20.563 --> 00:12:24.622
I think Hwang Jeong Won drugged my drink.

00:12:25.609 --> 00:12:28.936
I don't remember anything after that.

00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:34.754
Aren't you going to apologize?

00:12:39.374 --> 00:12:42.401
I'm sorry.

00:12:49.483 --> 00:12:52.283
So in the end,

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:57.877
you think this is my fault. Right?

00:13:38.675 --> 00:13:41.934
Then you should apologize to me too.

00:13:42.975 --> 00:13:46.859
That tax evasion setup
Director Lee staged back then...

00:13:46.859 --> 00:13:49.548
You knew about it, didn't you?

00:13:49.548 --> 00:13:54.464
If you'd told me then,
I could've handled it somehow.

00:13:54.464 --> 00:13:58.677
Were you really just looking out for yourself?

00:14:02.317 --> 00:14:07.277
Everything that's happened to me...

00:14:07.277 --> 00:14:11.823
I thought I deserved it.

00:14:11.823 --> 00:14:14.831
I thought it was the price

00:14:14.831 --> 00:14:16.907
I had to pay for hurting people,

00:14:16.907 --> 00:14:21.154
for stepping on them just to survive...

00:14:21.154 --> 00:14:25.240
for never apologizing.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:29.127
So yeah... it hurt.

00:14:33.855 --> 00:14:36.726
But in the end, I was the one who got played.

00:14:36.726 --> 00:14:40.079
When I was falling apart,
when I was at my lowest...

00:14:40.079 --> 00:14:43.376
you couldn't even say it wasn't my fault.

00:14:43.376 --> 00:14:47.432
That I'd already paid the price.

00:14:53.936 --> 00:14:55.813
I'm sorry.

00:14:55.813 --> 00:14:58.435
Is that enough?

00:15:00.083 --> 00:15:02.580
Go to Lee Yang Mi and beg her.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.571
- What?
- We can't beat her.

00:15:04.571 --> 00:15:07.133
We can't! Damn it!

00:15:07.133 --> 00:15:10.963
Get on your knees if you have to,
just please!

00:15:10.963 --> 00:15:16.179
It's your pathetic pride that got us here!

00:15:20.958 --> 00:15:23.103
Hey.

00:15:23.103 --> 00:15:24.795
Do you even know

00:15:24.795 --> 00:15:29.148
what I've been trying to protect,
putting up with all this crap to stay here?

00:15:29.148 --> 00:15:30.805
What? Pathetic pride?

00:15:30.805 --> 00:15:34.728
Pathetic pride?

00:15:37.234 --> 00:15:38.258
You think

00:15:38.258 --> 00:15:40.813
I came this far, getting stomped on like this,

00:15:40.813 --> 00:15:44.505
just to sell you out and save myself?

00:15:44.505 --> 00:15:48.086
Hey!

00:15:48.086 --> 00:15:49.330
Do I

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.354
even matter to you?

00:15:51.354 --> 00:15:54.776
Do you ever even look back
when I call your name?

00:16:12.811 --> 00:16:15.558
Do you have any idea

00:16:15.558 --> 00:16:18.118
what it's been like for me,

00:16:18.878 --> 00:16:22.496
standing next to you all this time?

00:16:22.496 --> 00:16:25.874
How lonely it's been, watching you.

00:16:25.874 --> 00:16:28.785
Did you ever think about that?

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:33.840
And this is my fault?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.980
Even then...

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:38.392
I was trying to hold on to us.

00:16:38.392 --> 00:16:43.537
I kept holding on, and holding on.

00:16:43.537 --> 00:16:45.591
And you...

00:16:45.591 --> 00:16:50.253
how could you say that to me?

00:16:56.353 --> 00:16:59.080
Right.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.709
In the end, you just wanted me.

00:17:02.709 --> 00:17:05.366
Didn't you?

00:17:23.893 --> 00:17:26.232
Let go.

00:17:31.576 --> 00:17:33.942
Let go.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:55.773
Let go.

00:17:55.773 --> 00:17:58.695
Let go, damn it!

00:18:02.444 --> 00:18:04.731
Yeah...

00:18:04.731 --> 00:18:07.557
Maybe...

00:18:09.797 --> 00:18:13.017
we should die.

00:18:14.756 --> 00:18:17.530
We should just end it.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:20.624
Maybe that's better.

00:19:37.446 --> 00:19:39.230
<i>I can't imagine my life</i>

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:43.142
<i>without Chu Sang Ah.</i>

00:19:43.142 --> 00:19:47.419
<i>It wasn't easy being with her.</i>

00:19:47.419 --> 00:19:53.072
<i>It was the best decision
and the biggest risk of my life.</i>

00:19:58.052 --> 00:19:59.326
[Murder and tax evasion:
an actress with both charges]

00:19:59.326 --> 00:20:01.685
<i>We made a promise.</i>

00:20:01.685 --> 00:20:05.429
<i>To be the best partners for each other.</i>

00:20:05.429 --> 00:20:06.896
<i>But it turned out</i>

00:20:06.896 --> 00:20:09.349
<i>to be the worst decision he ever made.</i>

00:20:09.349 --> 00:20:12.959
<i>Their marriage, dressed up like
the romance everyone dreams of,</i>

00:20:12.959 --> 00:20:17.519
<i>was really a sham hiding something far uglier.</i>

00:22:05.185 --> 00:22:09.017
[Together with Changjo Party]

00:22:22.772 --> 00:22:24.722
I'm sorry.

00:22:24.722 --> 00:22:26.675
I know it may sound like an excuse,

00:22:26.675 --> 00:22:29.225
but that video was manipulated.

00:22:29.225 --> 00:22:31.552
I'll do everything I can

00:22:31.552 --> 00:22:35.971
to contain this and keep the party
from taking damage.

00:22:37.405 --> 00:22:39.728
Please,

00:22:39.728 --> 00:22:41.409
please give me one last chance...

00:22:41.409 --> 00:22:42.726
We've already...

00:22:42.726 --> 00:22:47.842
explored every option on our end.

00:22:47.842 --> 00:22:51.068
This is the best we can do.

00:23:04.448 --> 00:23:07.815
[Bang Tae Seop to announce departure
from the Changjo Party]

00:23:16.456 --> 00:23:20.249
Damn it!

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:26.176
<i>First,</i>

00:23:26.176 --> 00:23:31.105
<i>I sincerely apologize for the disappointment</i>

00:23:31.105 --> 00:23:34.542
<i>and confusion my personal conduct has caused</i>

00:23:34.542 --> 00:23:38.153
<i>the Changjo Party, its members, and everyone</i>

00:23:38.153 --> 00:23:41.966
<i>who supported my campaign.</i>

00:23:42.679 --> 00:23:46.012
<i>This is entirely my responsibility</i>

00:23:47.098 --> 00:23:52.864
<i>and stems from my personal conduct.</i>

00:23:56.165 --> 00:23:58.138
[Bang Tae Seop to announce departure
from the Changjo Party]

00:23:58.138 --> 00:24:00.300
[Chu Sang Ah scandal and Hwang Jeong Won]

00:24:59.429 --> 00:25:00.687
Get the hell out of here.

00:25:00.687 --> 00:25:02.980
You're heading to Chu's place, right?
What's your relationship?

00:25:02.980 --> 00:25:06.540
The public has a right to know.

00:25:06.540 --> 00:25:08.850
What? Just get lost.

00:25:08.850 --> 00:25:11.437
Get that camera out!

00:25:11.437 --> 00:25:13.200
Just one comment, please.

00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:14.447
Hey.

00:25:14.447 --> 00:25:17.071
Worry about your own wife first.

00:25:17.071 --> 00:25:19.774
Take a good look at yourself.

00:25:19.774 --> 00:25:24.906
Hey, I'm calling the cops for trespassing!

00:25:34.704 --> 00:25:37.121
I knew from the start

00:25:37.121 --> 00:25:40.947
this marriage was a mistake.

00:25:43.966 --> 00:25:46.252
I knew

00:25:46.252 --> 00:25:49.362
you'd stab him in the back,

00:25:49.362 --> 00:25:52.702
one way or another.

00:25:54.653 --> 00:25:59.119
So why didn't I stop it?

00:26:01.236 --> 00:26:03.799
Because even though he's my brother,

00:26:03.799 --> 00:26:09.019
I've never once been able to beat him.

00:26:13.107 --> 00:26:16.127
Just blame me.

00:26:18.490 --> 00:26:20.573
Yeah, I will.

00:26:20.573 --> 00:26:23.231
I came here ready to tear into you.

00:26:23.231 --> 00:26:27.768
For ruining my brother's life
while he was out there fighting for it.

00:26:27.768 --> 00:26:34.083
I was ready to rip you
and that other bitch apart.

00:26:34.083 --> 00:26:36.856
My gosh...

00:26:36.856 --> 00:26:40.506
Look at you. Look at this place.

00:26:40.506 --> 00:26:42.836
Seems like the damage is already done.

00:26:42.836 --> 00:26:44.730
What's the point of me going off now?

00:26:44.730 --> 00:26:47.950
Just stabbing a corpse at this point.

00:26:47.950 --> 00:26:51.569
The only thing I'd get is a sore arm.

00:26:58.080 --> 00:26:59.676
So...

00:26:59.676 --> 00:27:02.245
why...

00:27:12.464 --> 00:27:15.117
Why...

00:27:35.433 --> 00:27:38.049
You're a bitch,

00:27:38.049 --> 00:27:41.374
but you were...

00:27:41.374 --> 00:27:44.874
filmed without your consent.

00:27:44.874 --> 00:27:48.158
You are a victim.

00:27:53.746 --> 00:27:56.683
Still, be ashamed.

00:27:56.683 --> 00:27:59.006
Be ashamed enough to want to die.

00:27:59.006 --> 00:28:01.826
Hurt like hell.

00:28:01.826 --> 00:28:04.596
You're not just anyone. You're a public figure.

00:28:04.596 --> 00:28:08.476
This is yours to carry.

00:28:11.837 --> 00:28:16.103
So take the punishment. Take all of it.

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:19.223
But,

00:28:19.223 --> 00:28:21.661
don't go talking about

00:28:21.661 --> 00:28:24.475
dying again like last time.

00:28:24.475 --> 00:28:29.006
If you die, I'll dig you back up myself

00:28:29.006 --> 00:28:32.679
and drag you out.

00:28:33.907 --> 00:28:37.246
Just grit your teeth and live.

00:28:38.164 --> 00:28:42.075
Live through it, and make it right.

00:28:42.075 --> 00:28:44.721
Got it?

00:29:34.845 --> 00:29:38.018
It's your birthday, isn't it?

00:29:41.429 --> 00:29:44.703
What a damn way

00:29:44.703 --> 00:29:47.315
to be born.

00:30:26.259 --> 00:30:28.004
He

00:30:28.004 --> 00:30:29.791
probably

00:30:29.791 --> 00:30:33.210
saw himself in you.

00:30:33.929 --> 00:30:36.520
In a world even your own mother
walked away from,

00:30:36.520 --> 00:30:39.629
all on your own,

00:30:39.629 --> 00:30:43.965
you fought like hell just to survive...

00:30:43.965 --> 00:30:46.717
That's who you are.

00:31:40.547 --> 00:31:44.399
[Lee Yang Mi]

00:33:01.309 --> 00:33:04.542
What are you waiting for?

00:33:05.395 --> 00:33:09.568
You're thinking about
where it all went wrong, right?

00:33:10.607 --> 00:33:13.554
That you shouldn't have walked in here
that day.

00:33:13.554 --> 00:33:16.814
Shouldn't have played the Nam Hye Hoon card.

00:33:16.814 --> 00:33:19.831
Shouldn't have teamed up with
that idiot Kwon Jong Uk...

00:33:19.831 --> 00:33:23.657
Yeah, a lot's probably going through your head.

00:33:24.546 --> 00:33:27.278
But hey, you're wrong.

00:33:27.278 --> 00:33:30.642
It's not any of that.

00:33:30.642 --> 00:33:35.771
The worst decision you ever made
was marrying Chu Sang Ah.

00:33:35.771 --> 00:33:40.558
The best one I ever made was
marrying Kwon Se Myeong.

00:33:41.901 --> 00:33:45.034
Now do you get it?

00:33:58.394 --> 00:34:01.440
This is your last chance.

00:34:01.440 --> 00:34:04.466
Your call.

00:35:29.974 --> 00:35:33.646
Let's die together

00:35:37.574 --> 00:35:40.207
tonight.

00:35:46.564 --> 00:35:49.537
Have you lost your mind?

00:35:50.437 --> 00:35:54.470
It's not fair dying alone.

00:35:54.470 --> 00:35:58.663
But before that, let me ask you one thing.

00:35:58.663 --> 00:36:02.623
Why go this far?

00:36:05.356 --> 00:36:07.829
Sang Ah...

00:36:08.516 --> 00:36:14.496
Why are you so set on dragging her
all the way down?

00:36:18.535 --> 00:36:23.028
Because that's all you have left.

00:36:23.713 --> 00:36:26.880
Out of everything you have,

00:36:26.880 --> 00:36:31.020
that's the only thing worth anything.

00:36:32.286 --> 00:36:34.613
Damn it.

00:36:38.689 --> 00:36:41.955
You think this is rock bottom?

00:36:41.955 --> 00:36:44.955
You think this is the end?

00:36:44.955 --> 00:36:47.902
Don't be ridiculous.

00:36:51.107 --> 00:36:52.911
You want to die?

00:36:52.911 --> 00:36:55.336
You really think you can go through with it?

00:36:55.336 --> 00:36:57.931
After humiliating yourself?

00:36:57.931 --> 00:37:01.284
I know exactly who you are.

00:37:01.957 --> 00:37:07.211
You knew this was your last shot
when you walked in.

00:37:08.463 --> 00:37:12.216
So think it through.

00:37:12.216 --> 00:37:16.683
What you do right now decides everything.

00:37:16.683 --> 00:37:20.396
Your life. And Chu Sang Ah's.

00:37:20.396 --> 00:37:22.969
Got it?

00:39:10.758 --> 00:39:13.349
It's Chu Sang Ah. She's coming out!

00:39:13.349 --> 00:39:15.482
<i>How did we...</i>

00:39:15.482 --> 00:39:19.142
<i>end up as monsters?</i>

00:39:21.490 --> 00:39:24.183
<i>Bang Tae Seop...</i>

00:39:24.183 --> 00:39:25.973
<i>I'm not letting it end like this.</i>

00:39:25.973 --> 00:39:28.153
Could you comment on the controversy?

00:39:28.153 --> 00:39:32.197
<i>I'll use every means
I have to bring Lee Yang Mi down.</i>

00:39:32.197 --> 00:39:33.802
Just one statement, please.

00:39:33.802 --> 00:39:35.873
<i>I'll take back everything you lost,</i>

00:39:35.873 --> 00:39:40.446
<i>and everything that was taken from me.</i>

00:39:47.093 --> 00:39:50.092
- Chu Sang Ah!
- Wait!

00:39:53.137 --> 00:39:54.336
Chu Sang Ah!

00:39:54.336 --> 00:39:55.417
Just a moment!

00:39:55.417 --> 00:39:58.192
Sang Ah!

00:40:06.724 --> 00:40:09.510
<i>You're just like me.</i>

00:40:09.510 --> 00:40:12.982
<i>We're the same kind.</i>

00:40:12.982 --> 00:40:16.736
<i>I know exactly</i>

00:40:16.736 --> 00:40:20.049
<i>what you're capable of.</i>

00:40:22.411 --> 00:40:25.164
<i>You do it your way.</i>

00:40:25.164 --> 00:40:28.772
<i>I will do it my way.</i>

00:40:28.772 --> 00:40:29.900
[You do it your way, I will do it my way]

00:40:29.900 --> 00:40:34.500
<i>Let's see this through.
Each of us, to the end we want.</i>

00:41:42.666 --> 00:41:45.263
This is the ancestral grave of Gu Hong Seo,

00:41:45.263 --> 00:41:48.008
Son Guk Won's only real rival.

00:41:48.008 --> 00:41:50.032
Your task is

00:41:50.032 --> 00:41:53.869
to cut off that family line for good.

00:41:53.869 --> 00:41:58.894
This is no different from
putting a hit on the dead...

00:41:58.894 --> 00:42:04.481
so you have to drive it straight
into the skull and the heart.

00:42:04.481 --> 00:42:06.945
That's the only way to end it.

00:42:06.945 --> 00:42:08.895
But

00:42:08.895 --> 00:42:11.994
you'd be going against
the natural order of life and death.

00:42:11.994 --> 00:42:16.667
Whoever does it will have to pay a price.

00:42:17.533 --> 00:42:20.973
For example...

00:42:21.746 --> 00:42:27.199
someone closest to you might take the hit.

00:43:53.547 --> 00:43:58.639
[Missed Call]
[Chu Sang Ah]

00:44:23.310 --> 00:44:26.185
[To: Bang Tae Seop,
701, 27-9 Gachan 1-dong, Dongnam-gu, Seoam-si]

00:44:32.612 --> 00:44:35.718
What are you doing?

00:44:55.973 --> 00:44:58.050
Is this what you got for humiliating yourself?

00:44:58.050 --> 00:45:00.593
Watch your mouth.

00:45:02.882 --> 00:45:07.835
I'm giving you this for everything
we've been through.

00:45:08.810 --> 00:45:11.743
I'm leaving.

00:45:12.577 --> 00:45:15.297
Don't come looking for me.

00:45:18.453 --> 00:45:21.483
You messing with me right now?

00:45:21.483 --> 00:45:24.803
Do you know what I've done for you?

00:45:24.803 --> 00:45:26.648
You think I'll take this and just walk away?

00:45:26.648 --> 00:45:30.209
Stop doing this kind of shit

00:45:31.109 --> 00:45:34.662
and start living like a decent person.

00:45:34.662 --> 00:45:37.266
I'm also starting over

00:45:37.266 --> 00:45:40.659
somewhere no one knows me.

00:45:49.393 --> 00:45:51.675
What, you think you're somebody now

00:45:51.675 --> 00:45:55.528
because you've been hanging around Chu Sang Ah?

00:45:56.825 --> 00:45:59.797
Don't bullshit me.

00:46:13.538 --> 00:46:16.437
Woo Sik...

00:46:49.482 --> 00:46:52.508
Where are you going?

00:47:01.649 --> 00:47:04.449
Running away?

00:47:38.363 --> 00:47:43.949
You're the only proof left
that Lee Yang Mi did this to me.

00:47:43.949 --> 00:47:47.388
And you're just going to walk away like this?

00:47:48.123 --> 00:47:52.021
Yeah, maybe your life got messed up
because of me and Bang Tae Seop,

00:47:52.021 --> 00:47:56.439
but if you run now just to save yourself,

00:47:56.439 --> 00:47:59.386
I'm done.

00:48:09.894 --> 00:48:12.292
You came here knowing everything, so go ahead.

00:48:12.292 --> 00:48:15.018
Make your excuses.

00:48:27.871 --> 00:48:31.397
There's nothing to explain.

00:48:33.216 --> 00:48:37.210
You just got unlucky...

00:48:37.210 --> 00:48:40.800
meeting someone like me.

00:48:40.800 --> 00:48:43.960
That's what ruined your life.

00:48:51.173 --> 00:48:55.079
You didn't know I was this kind of person?

00:48:57.293 --> 00:49:02.013
I've had blood on my hands
just trying to survive,

00:49:02.962 --> 00:49:07.529
spent my whole life screwing people over.

00:49:11.525 --> 00:49:15.785
And you thought there was something real in me?

00:49:22.139 --> 00:49:24.685
Maybe.

00:49:25.806 --> 00:49:28.565
But I meant it.

00:49:30.735 --> 00:49:33.535
Even if

00:49:34.120 --> 00:49:37.473
it was just for a moment.

00:49:44.317 --> 00:49:47.650
One last favor.

00:49:48.877 --> 00:49:53.904
I'm going to use everything
I have to take Lee Yang Mi down.

00:49:53.904 --> 00:49:56.041
So everything you saw,

00:49:56.041 --> 00:49:59.916
everything you heard, everything you know.

00:49:59.916 --> 00:50:05.122
Anything I can use to go after her,
lay it all out.

00:50:15.707 --> 00:50:18.507
You and me...

00:50:19.458 --> 00:50:22.631
if we go any further,

00:50:23.824 --> 00:50:27.384
it won't just end with us getting hurt.

00:50:33.211 --> 00:50:36.997
So stop. Right here.

00:51:14.040 --> 00:51:15.550
<i>Did I</i>

00:51:15.550 --> 00:51:18.524
<i>really want you dead?</i>

00:51:18.524 --> 00:51:21.554
I'm already dead anyway.

00:51:21.554 --> 00:51:25.011
When Ji Soo died like that,
something in me died too.

00:51:25.011 --> 00:51:28.387
Living like this...

00:51:28.387 --> 00:51:31.418
it's no different from being dead.

00:51:31.418 --> 00:51:36.878
So even if I break,
I'm taking her down with me.

00:51:37.976 --> 00:51:40.158
Please...

00:51:40.158 --> 00:51:43.898
Just stop. Please!

00:51:46.554 --> 00:51:48.900
Please.

00:52:18.296 --> 00:52:20.942
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:52:21.622 --> 00:52:24.928
<i>We've become monsters.</i>

00:52:26.129 --> 00:52:28.781
- Oh, no!
- No!

00:52:32.416 --> 00:52:34.976
Jeong Won...

00:52:49.839 --> 00:52:52.226
Go after him.

00:52:56.662 --> 00:52:59.022
Jeong Won...

00:52:59.022 --> 00:53:02.088
Jeong Won... look at me.

00:53:03.795 --> 00:53:06.335
What do I do?

00:53:11.522 --> 00:53:14.303
Wait...

00:53:14.303 --> 00:53:16.469
Jeong Won!

00:53:16.469 --> 00:53:18.886
Look at me.

00:53:18.886 --> 00:53:21.972
Stay with me...

00:53:23.373 --> 00:53:26.026
Please, stay with me.

00:53:26.026 --> 00:53:28.626
Jeong Won...

00:53:34.819 --> 00:53:37.806
Please stay with me.

00:53:38.966 --> 00:53:40.503
Please...

00:53:40.503 --> 00:53:42.859
Jeong Won...

00:53:47.686 --> 00:53:49.572
Jeong Won.

00:53:49.572 --> 00:53:51.818
Hey...

00:53:56.130 --> 00:53:57.881
Jeong Won.

00:53:57.881 --> 00:54:00.261
Please.

00:54:52.940 --> 00:54:54.454
[Sang Ah]

00:54:56.528 --> 00:55:00.264
<i>The number you have dialed is
currently unavailable...</i>

00:55:08.969 --> 00:55:12.295
<i>Sir, are you Chu Sang Ah's husband?</i>

00:55:13.582 --> 00:55:15.087
Yes...

00:55:15.087 --> 00:55:17.870
what is it?

00:55:17.870 --> 00:55:19.460
So

00:55:19.460 --> 00:55:23.917
you're saying a man in his 30s,

00:55:23.917 --> 00:55:28.649
wearing a black top,
stabbed Hwang Jeong Won and fled.

00:55:33.457 --> 00:55:37.377
You didn't get a clear look at his face?

00:57:21.899 --> 00:57:26.612
Disappointed it wasn't me?

00:57:39.361 --> 00:57:40.612
It wasn't me, damn it!

00:57:40.612 --> 00:57:42.201
- Hey, keep it down.
- Let go!

00:57:42.201 --> 00:57:44.644
- It wasn't me! I didn't do it!
- Be quiet!

00:57:44.644 --> 00:57:46.070
- Quiet.
- Hey!

00:57:46.070 --> 00:57:47.895
You know it wasn't me. You saw it.

00:57:47.895 --> 00:57:49.763
- Shut it. Move.
- You saw it!

00:57:49.763 --> 00:57:52.037
- Move.
- Hey! Chu Sang Ah!

00:57:52.037 --> 00:57:53.827
You saw I didn't stab her!

00:57:53.827 --> 00:57:56.707
Hey! Chu Sang Ah!

00:58:01.050 --> 00:58:03.705
What are you going to do now?

00:58:03.705 --> 00:58:05.402
It's not him.

00:58:05.402 --> 00:58:08.465
I know it.

00:58:08.465 --> 00:58:10.561
So what?

00:58:10.561 --> 00:58:14.261
You think stepping in now helps you?

00:58:17.421 --> 00:58:20.855
Don't get dragged into anything else.

00:58:20.855 --> 00:58:23.708
This is as far as it goes.

00:58:35.559 --> 00:58:39.593
<i>A rookie actress, identified as Hwang,
has been killed by a stalker.</i>

00:58:39.593 --> 00:58:43.986
<i>Nine years ago, she was charged with
attempted murder of her mother's partner,</i>

00:58:43.986 --> 00:58:48.410
<i>and is believed to have concealed her past
to pursue an acting career.</i>

00:58:48.410 --> 00:58:50.107
<i>The suspect was arrested at the scene.</i>

00:58:50.107 --> 00:58:53.120
<i>He had been stalking her since last year</i>

00:58:53.120 --> 00:58:54.611
<i>and has multiple prior convictions
for violence,</i>

00:58:54.611 --> 00:58:57.637
[Ms. Hwang brutally killed after fight with ex]
<i>including several arrests.</i>

00:58:57.637 --> 00:59:01.321
<i>Meanwhile, based on the bundles of
cash found in a bag in the car,</i>

00:59:01.321 --> 00:59:04.524
<i>police are not ruling out the possibility that</i>

00:59:04.524 --> 00:59:07.981
<i>this was a contract killing,
not just a stalking crime.</i>

00:59:07.981 --> 00:59:12.355
[The media covered it all up. Right?
Acting while hiding a murder conviction...]

00:59:12.355 --> 00:59:16.314
[The agency casts a convicted murderer
as the lead? Oh my]

00:59:16.314 --> 00:59:18.515
[Why do people like this keep showing up?]

00:59:33.470 --> 00:59:36.868
[Hwang Jeong Won, 26, deceased]

01:00:18.801 --> 01:00:21.107
Darn it.

01:00:32.413 --> 01:00:34.500
Excuse me.

01:00:34.500 --> 01:00:37.490
What is your relationship to the deceased?

01:00:37.490 --> 01:00:39.997
Why?

01:00:39.997 --> 01:00:44.550
If there's no next of kin,
she'll be listed as unclaimed.

01:00:47.881 --> 01:00:50.345
I'm her next of kin.

01:00:50.345 --> 01:00:54.545
Then please sign here.

01:01:00.889 --> 01:01:06.881
[Relationship to the deceased: Next of kin]

01:01:41.834 --> 01:01:44.568
[Resident Registration Card, Hwang Jeong Won]

01:02:06.480 --> 01:02:09.859
[To: Bang Tae Seop,
701, 27-9 Gachan 1-dong, Dongnam-gu, Seoam-si]

01:02:09.859 --> 01:02:13.592
<i>What's got you so confident...</i>

01:02:18.156 --> 01:02:21.369
<i>You've got something, don't you?</i>

01:02:27.778 --> 01:02:33.244
<i>Remember when I worked under Bang Tae Seop
as a mole for the prosecution?</i>

01:02:41.907 --> 01:02:45.314
<i>If I spill what I've got,</i>

01:02:47.837 --> 01:02:51.404
<i>we all go down together.</i>

01:03:06.119 --> 01:03:10.799
<i>Kill Hwang Jeong Won.</i>

01:03:20.355 --> 01:03:23.821
[Dark web screenshot of Choi Ji Ho]

01:04:24.448 --> 01:04:28.627
This is the USB Hwang Jeong Won sent
before she died.

01:04:41.987 --> 01:04:45.659
It has CCTV footage of the man
who killed Park Jae Sang,

01:04:45.659 --> 01:04:50.495
and call records between the person
who ordered it and the broker.

01:04:50.495 --> 01:04:51.989
[Call Records]

01:04:55.617 --> 01:04:59.404
Is this blackmail, or loyalty?

01:04:59.404 --> 01:05:02.510
What does it look like to you?

01:05:04.359 --> 01:05:06.766
Well...

01:05:06.766 --> 01:05:10.016
Either way, it's not hard evidence.

01:05:10.016 --> 01:05:11.926
Well...

01:05:11.926 --> 01:05:14.133
It'll definitely get an investigation moving,

01:05:14.133 --> 01:05:18.206
and it'll be a headache for you.

01:05:19.590 --> 01:05:21.494
So

01:05:21.494 --> 01:05:25.800
besides getting into Son Guk Won's camp,
what else do you want?

01:05:27.200 --> 01:05:30.357
Clean up the leaked video.

01:05:30.357 --> 01:05:35.030
And get Sang Ah's film released.

01:05:42.470 --> 01:05:44.821
That's almost touching.

01:05:44.821 --> 01:05:46.846
After everything,

01:05:46.846 --> 01:05:50.351
you still have feelings for her?

01:05:51.025 --> 01:05:57.411
Until I make it to the Blue House,
my trophy needs to stay spotless.

01:06:02.814 --> 01:06:06.426
This is why I took you in.

01:06:28.102 --> 01:06:30.902
You really are

01:06:32.456 --> 01:06:35.922
a filthy bastard.

01:06:39.145 --> 01:06:41.945
You don't actually believe

01:06:42.763 --> 01:06:46.811
there's such a thing as a decent man,

01:06:46.811 --> 01:06:49.878
do you?

01:07:44.040 --> 01:07:46.751
<i>You're risking all that for what?</i>

01:07:46.751 --> 01:07:48.775
<i>I'm cutting Lee Yang Mi loose.</i>

01:07:48.775 --> 01:07:50.372
<i>What if I jerk the wheel?</i>

01:07:50.372 --> 01:07:53.431
<i>You're going over the edge.
It's only a matter of time.</i>

01:07:53.431 --> 01:07:56.234
<i>Medical malpractice. Soliciting murder.</i>

01:07:56.234 --> 01:07:59.494
<i>It'll be the most shocking story of the year.</i>

01:07:59.494 --> 01:08:00.884
<i>You didn't leave anything behind, huh?</i>

01:08:00.884 --> 01:08:02.558
<i>Make it look like suicide.</i>

01:08:02.558 --> 01:08:05.855
<i>I'll turn WR to dust.</i>

01:08:05.855 --> 01:08:08.799
<i>The real owner of WR</i>

01:08:08.799 --> 01:08:11.872
<i>is about to change.</i>